        <body>
            <div xml:id="d689">

                <pb facs="0744" n="735" sameAs="frus:frus1938v05/pg735"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.6363/3160: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Daniels</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-03-27T09:00:00-06:00">March 27, 1938—9
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 12:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>77. If there are conditions which justify Morgenthau<anchor n="87"
                        xml:id="d689-f1"/> take measures to cease buying silver he could take that
                    course at any time without a public statement concurrent with your note. It
                    would be regarded by Mexico and all the world in the nature of a reprisal.
                    Knowing the disposition of Mexicans I fear it may produce an impasse and prevent
                    possible future negotiations for payment.</p>
                <p>Do you not feel that I am entitled to fly to Washington for personal consultation
                    before a final decision is reached and made public in a situation fraught with
                    unpredictable consequences? I do not [like] idea of delivering the note and
                    leaving here immediately. It would be construed that I am not willing to face
                    any condition that may arise.</p>
                <p>I could reach Washington Tuesday afternoon<anchor n="88" xml:id="d689-f2"/> for
                    conference. I await instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Daniels</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
